 text-foreground group-hover:text-primary transition-colors text-sm","children":"ACL Injury Treatment in Hyderabad"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-1 line-clamp-2","children":"ACL (Anterior Cruciate Ligament) injury is one of the most common knee injuries, especially in athletes who play sports involving sudden stops and direction changes. Dr. B Harsha Vardhana Reddy provides expert ACL treatment at Apollo Hospitals, Financial District, Hyderabad."}]]}],["$","$L6","acl-tear",{"href":"/conditions/acl-tear","className":"bg-card border border-border hover:border-primary hover:shadow-md rounded-xl p-4 transition-all group","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-medium text-foreground group-hover:text-primary transition-colors text-sm","children":"ACL Tear & Knee Ligament Injuries Treatment in Hyderabad"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-1 line-clamp-2","children":"The anterior cruciate ligament (ACL) is one of the key ligaments that help stabilize the knee joint. ACL injuries commonly occur during sports that involve sudden stops, changes in direction, or jumping. Dr. B Harsha Vardhana Reddy is an expert in ACL reconstruction surgery at Yashoda Hospital, Hyderabad, using advanced arthroscopic techniques."}]]}],["$","$L6","achilles-tendinitis",{"href":"/conditions/achilles-tendinitis","className":"bg-card border border-border hover:border-primary hover:shadow-md rounded-xl p-4 transition-all group","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-medium text-foreground group-hover:text-primary transition-colors text-sm","children":"Achilles Tendinitis Treatment in Hyderabad"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-1 line-clamp-2","children":"Achilles tendinitis is an overuse injury of the Achilles tendon, the band of tissue connecting calf muscles to the heel bone. It's common in runners and middle-aged athletes. Dr. B Harsha Vardhana Reddy provides expert treatment at Apollo Hospitals, Financial District, Hyderabad."}]]}],["$","$L6","ankle-arthritis",{"href":"/conditions/ankle-arthritis","className":"bg-card border border-border hover:border-primary hover:shadow-md rounded-xl p-4 transition-all group","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-medium text-foreground group-hover:text-primary transition-colors text-sm","children":"Ankle Arthritis Treatment in Hyderabad"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-1 line-clamp-2","children":"Ankle arthritis causes pain and stiffness in the ankle joint due to cartilage wear. Unlike hip and knee arthritis, ankle arthritis is usually caused by previous injury. Dr. B Harsha Vardhana Reddy provides comprehensive ankle care at Apollo Hospitals, Financial District, Hyderabad."}]]}],["$","$L6","avascular-necrosis-avn",{"href":"/conditions/avascular-necrosis-avn","className":"bg-card border border-border hover:border-primary hover:shadow-md rounded-xl p-4 transition-all group","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-medium text-foreground group-hover:text-primary transition-colors text-sm","children":"Avascular Necrosis (AVN) Treatment in Hyderabad"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-1 line-clamp-2","children":"Avascular necrosis (AVN) occurs when blood supply to bone is disrupted, causing bone death. Most commonly affects the hip. Dr. B Harsha Vardhana Reddy specializes in AVN treatment at Apollo Hospitals, Financial District, Hyderabad."}]]}],["$","$L6","bakers-cyst",{"href":"/conditions/bakers-cyst","className":"bg-card border border-border hover:border-primary hover:shadow-md rounded-xl p-4 transition-all group","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-medium text-foreground group-hover:text-primary transition-colors text-sm","children":"Bakers Cyst (Popliteal Cyst) Treatment in Hyderabad"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-1 line-clamp-2","children":"A Baker's cyst is a fluid-filled swelling behind the knee. It's u